					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Godwin"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200370101,
					"content": "...Ugh, I am so ready to just get back to Mondstadt...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370102,
					"content": "Oh, Traveler! Hi! Can I ask you a favor?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370103,
					"content": "As you can see, I'm with the Knights, and I'm on patrol right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370104,
					"content": "I told my girlfriend I would send her a letter before too long, just to let her know I'm safe and sound.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370105,
					"content": "Then things got busy and I forgot all about it... dear me. Could you deliver this <color=#00E1FFFF>letter</color> to her for me? Her name's <color=#00E1FFFF>Glory</color>...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370106,
					"content": "Wait— Glory?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200370107,
					"content": "The blind girl... Dandelion Seed collector...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370108,
					"content": "Aha! You must be Godwin? Glory mentioned you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370109,
					"content": "Wha— How do you know Glory?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370110,
					"content": "She had us run an errand for her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200370111,
					"content": "She made you run an errand, you say? I hope it wasn't anything dangerous...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370112,
					"content": "She just asked us to get her some Dandelion Seeds, that's all. She said by releasing them into the wind, they would convey her heart's desires to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370113,
					"content": "Dandelion Seeds, eh? That does sound like my Glory alright.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370114,
					"content": "Hang on, she said you were supposed to be somewhere far away from Mondstadt?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200370115,
					"content": "Yes— erm, well that was the plan... Let me, uh, fill you in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370116,
					"content": "Did you hear about the time the Grand Master left Mondstadt and took four out of every five knights with him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370117,
					"content": "Right, well, I was one of the ones assigned to that expedition. But unfortunately... just as we were getting ready to set off, I realized I'd lost the keepsake that Glory gave me. By the time I was done looking for it, they'd already left...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370118,
					"content": "I—I still haven't figured out how to catch up with them, and in the meantime I've just been milling around here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370119,
					"content": "I can't bring myself to go back to Mondstadt. I can only imagine what the knights would think of me if I just came crawling back...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370120,
					"content": "Also... I promised Glory I would send her letters and gifts from all around the world. I said I would send her the world!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370121,
					"content": "If she found out I'd never even made it out of Mondstadt...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370122,
					"content": "You don't want to lose face.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370123,
					"content": "Please, deliver this <color=#00E1FFFF>letter</color> to <color=#00E1FFFF>Glory</color> for me won't you? I bet she's worried sick about me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370124,
						200370126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370124,
					"content": "Okay.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200370125,
					"content": "I can't thank you enough, Traveler! Please keep everything I just told you a secret though.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370126,
					"content": "Why not try the dandelion hotline?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200370127,
					"content": "There is so much I want to say to Glory, far more than a handful of Dandelion Seeds could ever hope to carry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200370128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				},
				{
					"id": 200370128,
					"content": "Thank you for taking her my letter. And remember, not a word about any of this!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Godwin"
				}
			]
		},
